        "accordion_E3NzDR": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Find Your Fit",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/blogs/all-about-ergonomic-chair/say-goodbye-to-discomfort-how-sihoo-ergonomic-chairs-support-your-body?_pos=7&_sid=d454fa23c&_ss=r\" title=\"https://sihoo.com.au/blogs/all-about-ergonomic-chair/say-goodbye-to-discomfort-how-sihoo-ergonomic-chairs-support-your-body?_pos=7&_sid=d454fa23c&_ss=r\">Say Goodbye to Discomfort: How Sihoo Ergonomic Chairs Support Your Body</a></p><p><a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/blogs/all-about-ergonomic-chair/comparison-of-sihoo-premium-chairs-doro-c300-vs-doro-s300\" title=\"https://sihoo.com.au/blogs/all-about-ergonomic-chair/comparison-of-sihoo-premium-chairs-doro-c300-vs-doro-s300\">Comparison of Sihoo Premium Chairs: Doro C300 vs. Doro S300</a></p><p>Check out our buying guide for you!</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_qNiX34": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>Dynamic Lumbar Support</strong><br/>The advanced lumbar support system automatically adjusts to your spine, providing continuous back comfort without any manual tweaking.</p><p><strong>Adaptive Design</strong><br/>Engineered to fit users from <strong>152 cm</strong> to <strong>191 cm</strong>, ensuring everyone enjoys optimal support.</p><p><strong>Spacious Cushion</strong><br/>A larger seat cushion enhances comfort and offers plenty of room, with an adjustable seat depth for a perfect personalised fit.</p><p><strong>6-Direction Adjustable<br/>Armrests</strong><br/>Armrests move in six directions up/down, forward/back, inward/outward, rotated inwards/outwards, plus linked recline support—giving you versatile arm positioning throughout long workdays.</p><p><strong>Easy Controls</strong><br/>Effortlessly adjust seat height, depth and recline angle using a single, conveniently placed handle.</p><p><strong>Flexible Backrest</strong><br/>The streamlined backrest flexes with your movements, offering continuous support as you shift position.</p><p><strong>Precision Headrest Adjustment</strong><br/>Fine-tune headrest height, depth or rotation to achieve the ideal neck support and comfort.</p><p><strong>Sleek, Modern Design</strong><br/>With its contemporary aesthetic, the Sihoo DORO C300 Pro complements any workspace—office, home or study.</p><p><strong>Breathable Mesh</strong><br/>Fully breathable mesh is elastic, soft and skin-friendly—durable, easy to clean and perfect for all-day comfort.</p><p><strong>Weight-Sensing Technology</strong><br/>Advanced sensors adapt to your body weight, delivering a balanced, effortless recline experience.</p><p> </p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "ff72739d-90fa-44b3-896f-ca72e4704c77": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<ul><li>Supports up to <strong>136 kg</strong></li><li>Dynamic lumbar support for all-day back comfort</li><li>Designed to suit users from <strong>152 cm</strong> to <strong>190 cm</strong> tall</li><li>Spacious seat cushion with adjustable depth</li><li>6D adjustable armrests for versatile support</li><li>Easy, single-handle adjustments</li><li>Certified by BIFMA and SGS for quality and durability</li><li>Endorsed by The Gadgeteer, MMORPG, and loved by thousands of workers for ergonomic excellence</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_pjxcLm": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Promises",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>30-Day Trial</strong><br/><br/>Experience this <a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\">ergonomic chair in Australia</a> in your own workspace for 30 days—returns accepted within this period.</p><p><strong>3-Year Warranty</strong><br/><br/>Enjoy lasting comfort and peace of mind with our full 3-year warranty.</p><p><strong>Fast Shipping</strong><br/><br/>Receive your chair in just 5–7 business days anywhere in Australia.</p><p><strong>Satisfaction Guarantee</strong><br/><br/>For any issues, contact <a>support@sihoo.com.au</a> for prompt assistance and guaranteed satisfaction.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_e36ENy": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions – SIHOO Doro C300 Pro</strong></p><p><strong>1. What makes the C300 Pro different from the standard C300?</strong><br/><br/>The C300 Pro adds an adjustable seat-depth mechanism for a tailored fit—especially beneficial for larger users—plus advanced 6D armrest support that the standard C300 doesn’t offer.</p><p><strong>2. How does the lumbar support work in the C300 Pro?</strong><br/><br/>Our Dynamic Lumbar system senses your spine’s contour and automatically adapts in real time, delivering continuous lower-back comfort with zero manual tweaks required.</p><p><strong>3. Can the C300 Pro accommodate taller users?</strong><br/><br/>Absolutely. The chair is designed to suit heights from <strong>152 cm up to 190 cm</strong> (and beyond), ensuring every user enjoys optimal ergonomic alignment.</p><p><strong>4. What is the advantage of the adjustable headrest in the C300 Pro?</strong><br/><br/>The independent headrest features both height and depth adjustments—lock in perfect neck support whether you’re deep in work, long gaming marathons or taking a quick break.</p><p><strong>5. How do the armrests on the C300 Pro enhance comfort?</strong><br/><br/>Our 6D armrests move up/down, forward/back, inward/outward and swivel—plus they link to the recline—so you get versatile elbow and forearm support no matter your task or posture.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
