          }
        },
        "text_6nRBfz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The larger seat cushion, 6D coordinated armrests, seat-depth adjustment and extensive height adjustability across multiple components make the Doro C300 Pro more adaptable to a wide range of body sizes. Whether you’re between 152 cm and 190 cm tall, you’ll sit comfortably even during long hours in the Doro C300 Pro.</p>",
