          }
        },
        "text_WniJ4e": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The armrests deliver true 6D adjustability, moving vertically by 6.8 cm, sliding front to back by 4.8 cm and side to side by 8 cm, rotating 70° inwards and outwards, and flipping up 35°. This comprehensive range of motion lets you position your arms exactly where you need them—whether you’re working, studying or gaming for hours on end—and they co-ordinate seamlessly with the backrest to maintain proper support even when you recline for a break.</p>",
