            "text": "<p>Adjusting the Doro C300 Pro is now truly effortless. An ergonomically placed lever on the right-hand side lets you fine-tune seat height, depth and recline angle with one smooth motion—no bending down or awkward reaching required. Simply grip the handle and tailor your seating position mid-session to maintain perfect posture all day.</p>",
