          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Doro C300 Pro’s headrest boasts multi-directional precision: easily raise or lower it, slide it forward or back, and rotate it to mirror the natural curve of your neck. Its generously sized cushion ensures plenty of surface area for side-resting, so whether you’re deep in focus or taking a momentary pause, you’ll enjoy tailored support and lasting comfort.</p>",
