          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sink into cloud-like comfort with the Doro C300 Pro’s full-coverage breathable mesh. Engineered for superior elasticity and gentle against the skin, it delivers an airy, refreshing feel throughout the day. Plus, the tough, stain-resistant weave resists sagging and is hassle-free to clean—keeping your chair looking and feeling fresh session after session.</p>",
